                    ('Description', 'description', '["Whenever a creature makes an attack roll against you before the spell ends, the attacker subtracts 1d4 from the attack roll."]', '<p>Whenever a creature makes an attack roll against you before the spell ends, the attacker subtracts 1d4 from the attack roll.</p>', 'ec1a1da0-4baf-459f-97e7-47697e8f6440'::uuid),
