                    ('Description', 'description', '["Once per turn, when you roll initiative or draw the blade:","You may make one attack as part of the same action.","This attack has advantage and deals +4d10 necrotic damage."]', '<p>Once per turn, when you roll initiative or draw the blade:</p> <p>You may make one attack as part of the same action.</p> <p>This attack has advantage and deals +4d10 necrotic damage.</p>', '71ba6ee7-fd0c-47ed-91b9-de4a70fba42c'::uuid),
