                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Cleric (Legacy)","Cleric","Warlock (Legacy) - The Celestial (Legacy)","Cleric - Light Domain","Druid - Circle of Wildfire (TCoE)","Paladin - Oath of Devotion","Paladin - Oath of Castigation","Warlock - The Genie (TCoE)"]', '', 'db4c6e58-a5ce-49d1-ae08-cd9be84784c1'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 275', '', 'db4c6e58-a5ce-49d1-ae08-cd9be84784c1'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618920-flame-strike', '', 'db4c6e58-a5ce-49d1-ae08-cd9be84784c1'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/703/evocation.png', '', 'db4c6e58-a5ce-49d1-ae08-cd9be84784c1'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"2","label":"2nd"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 2nd </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"60 ft. (5 ft.)","kind":"distance","distanceValue":60,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":{"shape":null,"value":5,"unit":"ft"}}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 60 ft. <span>(5 ft. <i></i>)</span> </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a ball of wax","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"Concentration 1 Minute","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","concentration":true,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> <i>Concentration</i> 1 Minute </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Evocation', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Evocation </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"DEX Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"DEX"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>DEX Save</span> </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Fire","damageTypes":["Fire"]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Fire </div> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You create a 5-foot-diameter sphere of fire in an unoccupied space on the ground within range. It lasts for the duration. Any creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of the sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.","As a Bonus Action, you can move the sphere up to 30 feet, rolling it along the ground. If you move the sphere into a creature’s space, that creature makes the save against the sphere, and the sphere stops moving for the turn.","When you move the sphere, you can direct it over barriers up to 5 feet tall and jump it across pits up to 10 feet wide. Flammable objects that aren’t being worn or carried start burning if touched by the sphere, and it sheds Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet.","Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2."]', '<div> <p>You create a 5-foot-diameter sphere of fire in an unoccupied space on the ground within range. It lasts for the duration. Any creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of the sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p> <p>As a Bonus Action, you can move the sphere up to 30 feet, rolling it along the ground. If you move the sphere into a creature’s space, that creature makes the save against the sphere, and the sphere stops moving for the turn.</p> <p>When you move the sphere, you can direct it over barriers up to 5 feet tall and jump it across pits up to 10 feet wide. Flammable objects that aren’t being worn or carried start <a>burning</a> if touched by the sphere, and it sheds <a>Bright Light</a> in a 20-foot radius and <a>Dim Light</a> for an additional 20 feet.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.</p> <span>* - (a ball of wax)</span> </div>', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Damage"]', '', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Druid (Legacy)","Sorcerer (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Druid","Sorcerer","Wizard","Warlock (Legacy) - The Celestial (Legacy)","Druid - Circle of Wildfire (TCoE)"]', '', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 275', '', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618919-flaming-sphere', '', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/708/conjuration.png', '', 'f95b603a-8ad5-4848-8d73-9e61c829c3cc'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"6","label":"6th"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 6th </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"60 ft.","kind":"distance","distanceValue":60,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 60 ft. </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a cockatrice feather","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"Concentration 1 Minute","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","concentration":true,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> <i>Concentration</i> 1 Minute </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Transmutation', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Transmutation </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"CON Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"CON"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>CON Save</span> </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Petrified","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Petrified </div> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You attempt to turn one creature that you can see within range into stone. The target makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it has the Restrained condition for the duration. On a successful save, its Speed is 0 until the start of your next turn. Constructs automatically succeed on the save.","A Restrained target makes another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves against this spell three times, the spell ends. If it fails its saves three times, it is turned to stone and has the Petrified condition for the duration. The successes and failures needn’t be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.","If you maintain your Concentration on this spell for the entire possible duration, the target is Petrified until the condition is ended by Greater Restoration or similar magic."]', '<div> <p>You attempt to turn one creature that you can see within range into stone. The target makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it has the <a>Restrained</a> condition for the duration. On a successful save, its Speed is 0 until the start of your next turn. Constructs automatically succeed on the save.</p> <p>A Restrained target makes another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves against this spell three times, the spell ends. If it fails its saves three times, it is turned to stone and has the <a>Petrified</a> condition for the duration. The successes and failures needn’t be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.</p> <p>If you maintain your <a>Concentration</a> on this spell for the entire possible duration, the target is Petrified until the condition is ended by <a>Greater Restoration</a> or similar magic.</p> <span>* - (a cockatrice feather)</span> </div>', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Control","Debuff"]', '', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Druid (Legacy)","Sorcerer (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Druid","Sorcerer","Wizard"]', '', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 275', '', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2618905-flesh-to-stone', '', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/722/transmutation.png', '', '91ab17b0-4eba-4efa-8d1f-3fe9b2b25045'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"1","label":"1st"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 1st </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action Ritual","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":true}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action <i>Ritual</i> </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"30 ft.","kind":"distance","distanceValue":30,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 30 ft. </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a drop of mercury","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"1 Hour","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"hour","concentration":false,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> 1 Hour </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Conjuration', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Conjuration </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"None","kind":"none","attackType":null,"ability":null}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <span>None</span> </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Movement (...)","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> Movement (...) </div> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["This spell creates a circular, horizontal plane of force, 3 feet in diameter and 1 inch thick, that floats 3 feet above the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. The disk remains for the duration, and can hold up to 500 pounds. If more weight is placed on it, the spell ends, and everything on the disk falls to the ground.","The disk is immobile while you are within 20 feet of it. If you move more than 20 feet away from it, the disk follows you so that it remains within 20 feet of you. It can move across uneven terrain, up or down stairs, slopes and the like, but it can''t cross an elevation change of 10 feet or more. For example, the disk can''t move across a 10-foot-deep pit, nor could it leave such a pit if it was created at the bottom.","If you move more than 100 feet from the disk (typically because it can''t move around an obstacle to follow you), the spell ends."]', '<div> <p>This spell creates a circular, horizontal plane of force, 3 feet in diameter and 1 inch thick, that floats 3 feet above the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. The disk remains for the duration, and can hold up to 500 pounds. If more weight is placed on it, the spell ends, and everything on the disk falls to the ground.</p> <p>The disk is immobile while you are within 20 feet of it. If you move more than 20 feet away from it, the disk follows you so that it remains within 20 feet of you. It can move across uneven terrain, up or down stairs, slopes and the like, but it can''t cross an elevation change of 10 feet or more. For example, the disk can''t move across a 10-foot-deep pit, nor could it leave such a pit if it was created at the bottom.</p> <p>If you move more than 100 feet from the disk (typically because it can''t move around an obstacle to follow you), the spell ends.</p> <span>* - (a drop of mercury)</span> </div>', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '287b1520-1bc1-4367-b8f4-89e31b5b7dbc'::uuid),
