                    ('School', 'school', 'Conjuration', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Conjuration </div> </div>', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"DEX Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"DEX"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>DEX Save</span> </div> </div>', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Piercing (...)","damageTypes":["Piercing"]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Piercing (...) </div> </div>', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You create a shard of ice and fling it at one creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Piercing damage. Hit or miss, the shard then explodes. The target and each creature within 5 feet of it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d6 Cold damage.","Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The Cold damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1."]', '<div> <p>You create a shard of ice and fling it at one creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Piercing damage. Hit or miss, the shard then explodes. The target and each creature within 5 feet of it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d6 Cold damage.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The Cold damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p> <span>* - (a drop of water or a piece of ice)</span> </div>', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Damage"]', '', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Druid (Legacy)","Sorcerer (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Druid","Sorcerer","Wizard"]', '', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 287', '', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619171-ice-knife', '', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/708/conjuration.png', '', '8a86ba0f-594d-4f26-900a-a5ec3f5367f3'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"4","label":"4th"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 4th </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"300 ft. (20 ft. *)","kind":"distance","distanceValue":300,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":{"shape":null,"value":20,"unit":"ft"}}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 300 ft. <span>(20 ft. <i></i> *)</span> </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a mitten","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"Instantaneous","kind":"instantaneous","value":null,"unit":null,"concentration":false,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> Instantaneous </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Evocation', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Evocation </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"DEX Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"DEX"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>DEX Save</span> </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Bludgeoning (...)","damageTypes":["Bludgeoning"]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Bludgeoning (...) </div> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["Hail falls in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range. Each creature in the Cylinder makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 2d10 Bludgeoning damage and 4d6 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.","Hailstones turn ground in the Cylinder into Difficult Terrain until the end of your next turn.","Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The Bludgeoning damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4."]', '<div> <p>Hail falls in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high <a>Cylinder</a> centered on a point within range. Each creature in the Cylinder makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 2d10 Bludgeoning damage and 4d6 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p> <p>Hailstones turn ground in the Cylinder into <a>Difficult Terrain</a> until the end of your next turn.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The Bludgeoning damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4.</p> <span>* - (a mitten)</span> </div>', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Damage","Control"]', '', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Druid (Legacy)","Sorcerer (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Druid","Sorcerer","Wizard","Cleric - Tempest Domain (PHB)","Druid - Circle of the Sea","Paladin - Oath of the Ancients"]', '', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 287', '', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619178-ice-storm', '', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/703/evocation.png', '', '167a951e-f1bb-4d90-b7c4-9b9e55248a6f'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"1","label":"1st"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 1st </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Minute Ritual","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","trigger":null,"ritual":true}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Minute <i>Ritual</i> </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"Touch","kind":"touch","distanceValue":null,"distanceUnit":null,"area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> Touch </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a pearl worth 100+ GP","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"Instantaneous","kind":"instantaneous","value":null,"unit":null,"concentration":false,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> Instantaneous </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Divination', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Divination </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"None","kind":"none","attackType":null,"ability":null}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <span>None</span> </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Detection","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> Detection </div> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You touch an object throughout the spell’s casting. If the object is a magic item or some other magical object, you learn its properties and how to use them, whether it requires Attunement , and how many charges it has, if any. You learn whether any ongoing spells are affecting the item and what they are. If the item was created by a spell, you learn that spell’s name.","If you instead touch a creature throughout the casting, you learn which ongoing spells, if any, are currently affecting it."]', '<div> <p>You touch an object throughout the spell’s casting. If the object is a magic item or some other magical object, you learn its properties and how to use them, whether it requires <a>Attunement</a>, and how many charges it has, if any. You learn whether any ongoing spells are affecting the item and what they are. If the item was created by a spell, you learn that spell’s name.</p> <p>If you instead touch a creature throughout the casting, you learn which ongoing spells, if any, are currently affecting it.</p> <span>* - (a pearl worth 100+ GP)</span> </div>', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Detection"]', '', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Bard (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Artificer (Legacy)","Bard","Wizard","Artificer","Cleric - Forge Domain (XGtE)","Cleric - Knowledge Domain (Legacy)","Warlock - Lantern Patron (OTTG)"]', '', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 287', '', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619180-identify', '', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/709/divination.png', '', 'dcf26318-895f-46e3-9e58-1468be8cf020'::uuid);
                """);

            migrationBuilder.Sql("""
                INSERT INTO "SpellComponents" ("Label", "Key", "Value", "Html", "SpellId") VALUES
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"1","label":"1st"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 1st </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Minute Ritual","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","trigger":null,"ritual":true}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Minute <i>Ritual</i> </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"Touch","kind":"touch","distanceValue":null,"distanceUnit":null,"area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> Touch </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"S, M *","verbal":false,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"ink worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes","consumed":true,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"10 Days","kind":"timed","value":10,"unit":"day","concentration":false,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> 10 Days </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Illusion', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Illusion </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"None","kind":"none","attackType":null,"ability":null}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <span>None</span> </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Communication","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> Communication </div> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You write on parchment, paper, or another suitable material and imbue it with an illusion that lasts for the duration. To you and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell, the writing appears normal, seems to be written in your hand, and conveys whatever meaning you intended when you wrote the text. To all others, the writing appears as if it were written in an unknown or magical script that is unintelligible. Alternatively, the illusion can alter the meaning, handwriting, and language of the text, though the language must be one you know.","If the spell is dispelled, the original script and the illusion both disappear.","A creature that has Truesight can read the hidden message."]', '<div> <p>You write on parchment, paper, or another suitable material and imbue it with an illusion that lasts for the duration. To you and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell, the writing appears normal, seems to be written in your hand, and conveys whatever meaning you intended when you wrote the text. To all others, the writing appears as if it were written in an unknown or magical script that is unintelligible. Alternatively, the illusion can alter the meaning, handwriting, and language of the text, though the language must be one you know.</p> <p>If the spell is dispelled, the original script and the illusion both disappear.</p> <p>A creature that has <a>Truesight</a> can read the hidden message.</p> <span>* - (ink worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)</span> </div>', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Communication"]', '', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Bard (Legacy)","Warlock (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Bard","Warlock","Wizard"]', '', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 288', '', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619173-illusory-script', '', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/704/illusion.png', '', '5bcd3894-38be-4c44-bc26-c69d9be0a7ba'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"5","label":"5th"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 5th </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"90 ft.","kind":"distance","distanceValue":90,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 90 ft. </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V","verbal":true,"somatic":false,"material":{"required":false,"description":null,"consumed":null,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V</span> </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"Concentration 1 Minute","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","concentration":true,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> <i>Concentration</i> 1 Minute </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Evocation', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Evocation </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"DEX Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"DEX"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>DEX Save</span> </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Fire (...)","damageTypes":["Fire"]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Fire (...) </div> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["Flames wreathe one creature you can see within range. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 8d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. On a failed save, the target also burns for the spell’s duration. The burning target sheds bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the saving throw. It takes 4d6 fire damage on a failed save, and the spell ends on a successful one. These magical flames can’t be extinguished by nonmagical means.","If damage from this spell kills a target, the target is turned to ash."]', '<div> <p>Flames wreathe one creature you can see within range. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 8d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. On a failed save, the target also burns for the spell’s duration. The burning target sheds bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the saving throw. It takes 4d6 fire damage on a failed save, and the spell ends on a successful one. These magical flames can’t be extinguished by nonmagical means.</p> <p>If damage from this spell kills a target, the target is turned to ash.</p> </div>', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Damage"]', '', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Sorcerer (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Sorcerer","Wizard"]', '', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Elemental Evil Player''s Companion, pg. 158', '', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2385-immolation', '', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/703/evocation.png', '', 'bd6b1010-9d30-4d0e-8361-33b566376885'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"9","label":"9th"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 9th </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Minute","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Minute </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"30 ft.","kind":"distance","distanceValue":30,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 30 ft. </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a statuette of the target worth 5,000+ GP","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"Until Dispelled","kind":"until_dispelled","value":null,"unit":null,"concentration":false,"endCondition":"Until Dispelled"}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> Until Dispelled </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Abjuration', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Abjuration </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"WIS Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"WIS"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>WIS Save</span> </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Restrained (...)","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Restrained (...) </div> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You create a magical restraint to hold a creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the target is unaffected, and it is immune to this spell for the next 24 hours. On a failed save, the target is imprisoned. While imprisoned, the target doesn’t need to breathe, eat, or drink, and it doesn’t age. Divination spells can’t locate or perceive the imprisoned target, and the target can’t teleport.","Until the spell ends, the target is also affected by one of the following effects of your choice:","Burial. The target is entombed beneath the earth in a hollow globe of magical force that is just large enough to contain the target. Nothing can pass into or out of the globe.","Chaining. Chains firmly rooted in the ground hold the target in place. The target has the Restrained condition and can’t be moved by any means.","Hedged Prison. The target is trapped in a demiplane that is warded against teleportation and planar travel. The demiplane is your choice of a labyrinth, a cage, a tower, or the like.","Minimus Containment. The target becomes 1 inch tall and is trapped inside an indestructible gemstone or a similar object. Light can pass through the gemstone (allowing the target to see out and other creatures to see in), but nothing else can pass through by any means.","Slumber. The target has the Unconscious condition and can’t be awoken.","Ending the Spell. When you cast the spell, specify a trigger that will end it. The trigger can be as simple or as elaborate as you choose, but the DM must agree that it has a high likelihood of happening within the next decade. The trigger must be an observable action, such as someone making a particular offering at the temple of your god, saving your true love, or defeating a specific monster.","A Dispel Magic spell can end the spell only if it is cast with a level 9 spell slot, targeting either the prison or the component used to create it."]', '<div> <p>You create a magical restraint to hold a creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the target is unaffected, and it is immune to this spell for the next 24 hours. On a failed save, the target is imprisoned. While imprisoned, the target doesn’t need to breathe, eat, or drink, and it doesn’t age. Divination spells can’t locate or perceive the imprisoned target, and the target can’t teleport.</p> <p>Until the spell ends, the target is also affected by one of the following effects of your choice:</p> <p><strong>Burial.</strong> The target is entombed beneath the earth in a hollow globe of magical force that is just large enough to contain the target. Nothing can pass into or out of the globe.</p> <p><strong>Chaining.</strong> Chains firmly rooted in the ground hold the target in place. The target has the <a>Restrained</a> condition and can’t be moved by any means.</p> <p><strong>Hedged Prison.</strong> The target is trapped in a demiplane that is warded against teleportation and planar travel. The demiplane is your choice of a labyrinth, a cage, a tower, or the like.</p> <p><strong>Minimus Containment.</strong> The target becomes 1 inch tall and is trapped inside an indestructible gemstone or a similar object. Light can pass through the gemstone (allowing the target to see out and other creatures to see in), but nothing else can pass through by any means.</p> <p><strong>Slumber.</strong> The target has the <a>Unconscious</a> condition and can’t be awoken.</p> <p><strong><em>Ending the Spell.</em></strong> When you cast the spell, specify a trigger that will end it. The trigger can be as simple or as elaborate as you choose, but the DM must agree that it has a high likelihood of happening within the next decade. The trigger must be an observable action, such as someone making a particular offering at the temple of your god, saving your true love, or defeating a specific monster.</p> <p>A <a>Dispel Magic</a> spell can end the spell only if it is cast with a level 9 spell slot, targeting either the prison or the component used to create it.</p> <span>* - (a statuette of the target worth 5,000+ GP)</span> </div>', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '36f35328-8061-4d2a-924f-90e46ab7d1b8'::uuid),
