                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"CON Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"CON"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>CON Save</span> </div> </div>', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Radiant","damageTypes":["Radiant"]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Radiant </div> </div>', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["A silvery beam of pale light shines down in a 5-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range. Until the spell ends, Dim Light fills the Cylinder, and you can take a Magic action on later turns to move the Cylinder up to 60 feet.","When the Cylinder appears, each creature in it makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d10 Radiant damage, and if the creature is shape-shifted (as a result of the Polymorph spell, for example), it reverts to its true form and can’t shape-shift until it leaves the Cylinder. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only. A creature also makes this save when the spell’s area moves into its space and when it enters the spell’s area or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.","Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 2."]', '<div> <p>A silvery beam of pale light shines down in a 5-foot-radius, 40-foot-high <a>Cylinder</a> centered on a point within range. Until the spell ends, <a>Dim Light</a> fills the Cylinder, and you can take a <a>Magic</a> action on later turns to move the Cylinder up to 60 feet.</p> <p>When the Cylinder appears, each creature in it makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d10 Radiant damage, and if the creature is <a>shape-shifted</a> (as a result of the <a>Polymorph</a> spell, for example), it reverts to its true form and can’t shape-shift until it leaves the Cylinder. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only. A creature also makes this save when the spell’s area moves into its space and when it enters the spell’s area or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 2.</p> <span>* - (a moonseed leaf)</span> </div>', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Damage","Control"]', '', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Druid (Legacy)","Druid","Cleric - Twilight Domain (TCoE)","Paladin - Oath of the Watchers (TCoE)","Paladin - Oath of the Ancients","Cleric - Night Domain (HCS)","Cleric - Moon Domain (TCSR)"]', '', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 300', '', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619134-moonbeam', '', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/703/evocation.png', '', 'a76faad4-e1e6-4496-a76a-011965bf5138'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"4","label":"4th"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 4th </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"30 ft.","kind":"distance","distanceValue":30,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 30 ft. </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a silver whistle","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"8 Hours","kind":"timed","value":8,"unit":"hour","concentration":false,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> 8 Hours </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Conjuration', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Conjuration </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"DEX Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"DEX"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>DEX Save</span> </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Force","damageTypes":["Force"]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Force </div> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You conjure a phantom watchdog in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hound remains for the duration or until the two of you are more than 300 feet apart from each other.","No one but you can see the hound, and it is intangible and invulnerable. When a Small or larger creature comes within 30 feet of it without first speaking the password that you specify when you cast this spell, the hound starts barking loudly. The hound has Truesight with a range of 30 feet.","At the start of each of your turns, the hound attempts to bite one enemy within 5 feet of it. That enemy must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 4d8 Force damage.","On your later turns, you can take a Magic action to move the hound up to 30 feet."]', '<div> <p>You conjure a phantom watchdog in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hound remains for the duration or until the two of you are more than 300 feet apart from each other.</p> <p>No one but you can see the hound, and it is intangible and invulnerable. When a Small or larger creature comes within 30 feet of it without first speaking the password that you specify when you cast this spell, the hound starts barking loudly. The hound has <a>Truesight</a> with a range of 30 feet.</p> <p>At the start of each of your turns, the hound attempts to bite one enemy within 5 feet of it. That enemy must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 4d8 Force damage.</p> <p>On your later turns, you can take a <a>Magic</a> action to move the hound up to 30 feet.</p> <span>* - (a silver whistle)</span> </div>', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Damage","Warding"]', '', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Wizard (Legacy)","Artificer (Legacy)","Wizard","Artificer","Cleric - Community Domain (HCS)"]', '', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 300', '', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619110-mordenkainens-faithful-hound', '', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/708/conjuration.png', '', '5a06a58b-97f0-43c1-b735-ea89fcc10371'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"7","label":"7th"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 7th </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Minute","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Minute </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"300 ft.","kind":"distance","distanceValue":300,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 300 ft. </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a miniature door worth 15+ GP","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"24 Hours","kind":"timed","value":24,"unit":"hour","concentration":false,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> 24 Hours </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Conjuration', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Conjuration </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"None","kind":"none","attackType":null,"ability":null}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <span>None</span> </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Exploration (...)","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> Exploration (...) </div> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You conjure a shimmering door in range that lasts for the duration. The door leads to an extradimensional dwelling and is 5 feet wide and 10 feet tall. You and any creature you designate when you cast the spell can enter the extradimensional dwelling as long as the door remains open. You can open or close it (no action required) if you are within 30 feet of it. While closed, the door is imperceptible.","Beyond the door is a magnificent foyer with numerous chambers beyond. The dwelling’s atmosphere is clean, fresh, and warm.","You can create any floor plan you like for the dwelling, but it can’t exceed 50 contiguous 10-foot Cubes . The place is furnished and decorated as you choose. It contains sufficient food to serve a nine-course banquet for up to 100 people. Furnishings and other objects created by this spell dissipate into smoke if removed from it.","A staff of 100 near-transparent servants attends all who enter. You determine the appearance of these servants and their attire. They are invulnerable and obey your commands. Each servant can perform tasks that a human could perform, but they can’t attack or take any action that would directly harm another creature. Thus the servants can fetch things, clean, mend, fold clothes, light fires, serve food, pour wine, and so on. The servants can’t leave the dwelling.","When the spell ends, any creatures or objects left inside the extradimensional space are expelled into the unoccupied spaces nearest to the entrance."]', '<div> <p>You conjure a shimmering door in range that lasts for the duration. The door leads to an extradimensional dwelling and is 5 feet wide and 10 feet tall. You and any creature you designate when you cast the spell can enter the extradimensional dwelling as long as the door remains open. You can open or close it (no action required) if you are within 30 feet of it. While closed, the door is imperceptible.</p> <p>Beyond the door is a magnificent foyer with numerous chambers beyond. The dwelling’s atmosphere is clean, fresh, and warm.</p> <p>You can create any floor plan you like for the dwelling, but it can’t exceed 50 contiguous 10-foot <a>Cubes</a>. The place is furnished and decorated as you choose. It contains sufficient food to serve a nine-course banquet for up to 100 people. Furnishings and other objects created by this spell dissipate into smoke if removed from it.</p> <p>A staff of 100 near-transparent servants attends all who enter. You determine the appearance of these servants and their attire. They are invulnerable and obey your commands. Each servant can perform tasks that a human could perform, but they can’t attack or take any action that would directly harm another creature. Thus the servants can fetch things, clean, mend, fold clothes, light fires, serve food, pour wine, and so on. The servants can’t leave the dwelling.</p> <p>When the spell ends, any creatures or objects left inside the extradimensional space are expelled into the unoccupied spaces nearest to the entrance.</p> <span>* - (a miniature door worth 15+ GP)</span> </div>', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Utility","Exploration"]', '', '58e50f30-b563-4bd0-808d-e8f7020c7194'::uuid),
