                    ('Description', 'description', '["You fortify up to six creatures you can see within range. The spell bestows 120 Temporary Hit Points, which you divide among the spell’s recipients."]', '<p>You fortify up to six creatures you can see within range. The spell bestows 120 Temporary Hit Points, which you divide among the spell’s recipients.</p>', 'e4bb65cc-44b9-4442-893e-002f0de81fd4'::uuid),
