                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Druid (Legacy)","Ranger (Legacy)","Sorcerer (Legacy)","Wizard (Legacy)","Artificer (Legacy)","Druid","Ranger","Sorcerer","Wizard","Artificer","Druid - Circle of the Sea","Paladin - Oath of the River (OTTG)"]', '', '288d9128-eb34-4174-8a7c-bdfdd5ccff37'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 340', '', '288d9128-eb34-4174-8a7c-bdfdd5ccff37'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619205-water-breathing', '', '288d9128-eb34-4174-8a7c-bdfdd5ccff37'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/722/transmutation.png', '', '288d9128-eb34-4174-8a7c-bdfdd5ccff37'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"3","label":"3rd"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 3rd </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action Ritual","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":true}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action <i>Ritual</i> </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"30 ft.","kind":"distance","distanceValue":30,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":null}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 30 ft. </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a piece of cork","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"1 Hour","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"hour","concentration":false,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> 1 Hour </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Transmutation', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Transmutation </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"None","kind":"none","attackType":null,"ability":null}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <span>None</span> </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Movement","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> Movement </div> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["This spell grants the ability to move across any liquid surface—such as water, acid, mud, snow, quicksand, or lava—as if it were harmless solid ground (creatures crossing molten lava can still take damage from the heat). Up to ten willing creatures of your choice within range gain this ability for the duration.","An affected target must take a Bonus Action to pass from the liquid’s surface into the liquid itself and vice versa, but if the target falls into the liquid, the target passes through the surface into the liquid below."]', '<div> <p>This spell grants the ability to move across any liquid surface—such as water, acid, mud, snow, quicksand, or lava—as if it were harmless solid ground (creatures crossing molten lava can still take damage from the heat). Up to ten willing creatures of your choice within range gain this ability for the duration.</p> <p>An affected target must take a Bonus Action to pass from the liquid’s surface into the liquid itself and vice versa, but if the target falls into the liquid, the target passes through the surface into the liquid below.</p> <span>* - (a piece of cork)</span> </div>', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Spell Tags', 'spellTags', '["Movement"]', '', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Available For', 'availableFor', '["Cleric (Legacy)","Druid (Legacy)","Ranger (Legacy)","Sorcerer (Legacy)","Artificer (Legacy)","Cleric","Druid","Ranger","Sorcerer","Artificer","Paladin - Oath of the River (OTTG)"]', '', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Source', 'source', 'Player’s Handbook, pg. 340', '', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Source URL', 'url', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619207-water-walk', '', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Image', 'imageUrl', 'https://www.dndbeyond.com/attachments/2/722/transmutation.png', '', '988678d6-4ce9-4295-8200-c77ccfbea510'::uuid),
                    ('Level', 'level', '{"levelNumber":"4","label":"4th"}', '<div> <div> Level </div> <div> 4th </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time', 'castingTime', '{"text":"1 Action","kind":"action","value":1,"unit":"action","trigger":null,"ritual":false}', '<div> <div> Casting Time </div> <div> 1 Action </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Range/Area', 'rangeArea', '{"text":"90 ft. (5 ft.)","kind":"distance","distanceValue":90,"distanceUnit":"ft","area":{"shape":null,"value":5,"unit":"ft"}}', '<div> <div> Range/Area </div> <div> 90 ft. <span>(5 ft. <i></i>)</span> </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Components', 'components', '{"text":"V, S, M *","verbal":true,"somatic":true,"material":{"required":true,"description":"a droplet of water","consumed":false,"costGp":null}}', '<div> <div> Components </div> <div> <span>V, S, M *</span> </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Duration', 'duration', '{"text":"Concentration 1 Minute","kind":"timed","value":1,"unit":"minute","concentration":true,"endCondition":null}', '<div> <div>Duration</div> <div> <i>Concentration</i> 1 Minute </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('School', 'school', 'Conjuration', '<div> <div> School </div> <div> Conjuration </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Attack/Save', 'attackSave', '{"text":"STR Save","kind":"save","attackType":null,"ability":"STR"}', '<div> <div> Attack/Save </div> <div> <i></i> <span>STR Save</span> </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Damage/Effect', 'damageEffect', '{"text":"Restrained (...)","damageTypes":[]}', '<div> <div> Damage/Effect </div> <div> <i></i> Restrained (...) </div> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Description', 'description', '["You conjure up a sphere of water with a 5-foot radius at a point you can see within range. The sphere can hover but no more than 10 feet off the ground. The sphere remains for the spell’s duration.","Any creature in the sphere’s space must make a Strength saving throw. On a successful save, a creature is ejected from that space to the nearest unoccupied space of the creature’s choice outside the sphere. A Huge or larger creature succeeds on the saving throw automatically, and a Large or smaller creature can choose to fail it. On a failed save, a creature is restrained by the sphere and is engulfed by the water. At the end of each of its turns, a restrained target can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success.","The sphere can restrain as many as four Medium or smaller creatures or one Large creature. If the sphere restrains a creature that causes it to exceed this capacity, a random creature that was already restrained by the sphere falls out of it and lands prone in a space within 5 feet of it.","As an action, you can move the sphere up to 30 feet in a straight line. If it moves over a pit, a cliff, or other drop-off, it safely descends until it is hovering 10 feet above the ground. Any creature restrained by the sphere moves with it. You can ram the sphere into creatures, forcing them to make the saving throw.","When the spell ends, the sphere falls to the ground and extinguishes all normal flames within 30 feet of it. Any creature restrained by the sphere is knocked prone in the space where it falls. The water then vanishes."]', '<div> <p>You conjure up a sphere of water with a 5-foot radius at a point you can see within range. The sphere can hover but no more than 10 feet off the ground. The sphere remains for the spell’s duration.</p> <p>Any creature in the sphere’s space must make a Strength saving throw. On a successful save, a creature is ejected from that space to the nearest unoccupied space of the creature’s choice outside the sphere. A Huge or larger creature succeeds on the saving throw automatically, and a Large or smaller creature can choose to fail it. On a failed save, a creature is <a>restrained</a> by the sphere and is engulfed by the water. At the end of each of its turns, a <a>restrained</a> target can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p> <p>The sphere can restrain as many as four Medium or smaller creatures or one Large creature. If the sphere restrains a creature that causes it to exceed this capacity, a random creature that was already <a>restrained</a> by the sphere falls out of it and lands <a>prone</a> in a space within 5 feet of it.</p> <p>As an action, you can move the sphere up to 30 feet in a straight line. If it moves over a pit, a cliff, or other drop-off, it safely descends until it is hovering 10 feet above the ground. Any creature <a>restrained</a> by the sphere moves with it. You can ram the sphere into creatures, forcing them to make the saving throw.</p> <p>When the spell ends, the sphere falls to the ground and extinguishes all normal flames within 30 feet of it. Any creature <a>restrained</a> by the sphere is knocked <a>prone</a> in the space where it falls. The water then vanishes.</p> <span>* - (a droplet of water)</span> </div>', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
                    ('Casting Time Note', 'castingTimeBlurb', '', '', '7d67b12a-deb3-4af5-a07c-4c50826967e2'::uuid),
